<title>SLOVAKIA: TENNIS-SLOVAKIA BEAT ISRAEL 3-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SLOVAKIA BEAT ISRAEL 3-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia beat Israel 3-1 in their Davis Cup Euro/African Zone group one second round tie on Sunday after winning the first reverse singles match.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Karol Kucera beat Eyal Ran 6-2 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>The second reverse singles was cancelled because of bad weather.</p>
</text>
